    "detailed_description": "Years ago, a visitor from another world foresaw doom for a certain civilization on Earth. To save its people, he gave them a child to be raised among them, hoping his knowledge and insight would be enough to save them from their fate.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs time passes, everyone can see there is something special about the child named Tristan. He grows up into a strong young man and saves his people from a deadly flood. Soon he is on the path to becoming their leader, and he sees great things in their future. But as Tristan guides the newly-established kingdom of Atlantis, will he lead them to the prosperous future he imagines\u2026 or does darkness still wait for them in the end?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Explore the origins of the legendary kingdom of Atlantis in an exciting new story split into five chapters.<br />\r\n-Unlock twenty upgrades to build Atlantis up from a small tribe to an advanced civilization.<br />\r\n-Challenge yourself with numerous match-3 puzzles to earn the resources Atlantis needs in order to progress and thrive.<br />\r\n-Learn the secrets of Atlantis\u2026 and the dangers of ambition.",
